WEBVTT

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.889
Cold leads stay cold when nobody has time to follow up.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.154
DealerEdge drafts a personalized nurture,

00:00:07.174 --> 00:00:08.350
by email and text,

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:10.326
sent at the right moment.

00:00:11.633 --> 00:00:12.797
When the right unit arrives,

00:00:12.817 --> 00:00:15.412
the right buyer gets an alert.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:17.353
After the sale,

00:00:17.373 --> 00:00:18.607
it sends service reminders,

00:00:18.627 --> 00:00:20.712
tips and upgrade offers.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.990
And every draft waits for your approval before it sends.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.826
Cold leads, brought back to your reps.

00:00:30.967 --> 00:00:32.935
Book a demo with DealerEdge.
